OL,3,GNEWSAStrathclyde University professor
OL,4,Asacked over sexual harassment
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FA professor at the University of
OL,8,FStrathclyde has been sacked from his
OL,9,Fpost after students accused him of
OL,10,Fsexual harassment.
OL,12,FDr Ibrahim Khadra was removed as
OL,13,FProfessor in Pharmaceutical Sciences
OL,14,Ffollowing an internal investigation,
OL,15,Fthe university said.
OL,17,FIn allegations first reported by
OL,18,FGlasgow Live, students said Khadra had
OL,19,Frequested intimate images and harassed
OL,20,Fthem via text messages and phone calls.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
